sell, from time to time, shares of common stock having an aggregate offering price of up to $<ix:nonFraction contextRef="c152" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SaleOfStockConsiderationReceivedPerTransaction" scale="0" unitRef="usd" id="ixv-8431">300,000,000</ix:nonFraction>. On July 17, 2026, the Company
