<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">At the closing of the Transaction, <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c66" name="us-gaap:SubsequentEventDescription" id="ixv-8435">the Company
