</div><p style="font: 10pt/115% Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><b>Objective</b></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt/115% Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt/115% Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The objective of our Management&#8217;s Discussion
and Analysis of Financial Condition and Results of Operations (&#8220;MD&amp;A&#8221;) is to provide users of our financial statements
with the following:</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt/115% Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

</div><table cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px;">
  <tr style="vertical-align: top">
