</div><p style="font: 10pt/115% Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Our MD&amp;A is provided as a supplement to, and should be read together
with, our unaudited condensed consolidated financial statements for the three and six month periods ended June 30, 2026 and 2025, included
